# This .gitkeep file ensures the data/processed/ directory is tracked by Git,
# even if it's empty. Processed data files generated by the PVS tools
# will be stored here. These files are typically not committed to Git
# (and should be added to .gitignore if they become large or numerous),
# but the directory structure itself is useful to maintain.

# Example:
# If the `pvs generate` command outputs files to this directory,
# they would appear alongside this .gitkeep file.
# e.g., prime_vector_1000000.parquet
